"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"No complete award itinerary is shown, so I would not book an award from these results yet. I’d check the United-program lead first if a lower reported USD fee and more reported seats are useful priorities; the tradeoff is that it has no schedule details, and its quote scope and award support for your one traveler are unverified.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A2@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United-program award lead · January 1\",\"v\":\"This date-only economy award summary reports 60,500 United miles, 9 seats, and USD 28.20 in award taxes. Its reported USD quote is lower than the Alaska lead’s USD 50.90, but both quote scopes are unknown, so that is only a raw quote comparison—not a like-for-like cost or savings comparison. The record has no schedule and no returned traveler count; confirm current availability and that the award can be booked for one traveler.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Other leads could be worth checking if their programs or carriers suit you better, but their points totals are not comparable across programs. Neither provides a complete schedule here.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska-program award lead · January 1\",\"v\":\"This date-only economy award summary reports 42,500 Alaska miles, 8 seats, and USD 50.90 in award taxes, with AS and JX listed as carriers. Consider checking it if the Alaska program or those carriers are preferable to the United lead. Its schedule and returned traveler count are absent, and the quote scope is unknown; the lower points figure cannot be compared directly with another program’s points.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A1@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan award lead · January 1\",\"v\":\"This date-only economy award summary reports 65,000 Aeroplan points, 2 seats, and CAD 116.50 in award taxes, with BR listed as the carrier. It is an alternative to check if Aeroplan or BR is a better fit. The schedule and returned traveler count are absent, the quote scope is unknown, and its CAD quote should not be compared with USD quotes without a common currency basis.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline · Cathay Pacific via Hong Kong\",\"v\":\"The cash itinerary departs SFO on January 1 at 10:55 p.m. local time and arrives in BKK January 4 at 10:35 a.m. local time, with one stop at HKG and 44 hours 40 minutes elapsed. The source reports a USD 640.00 cash fare, but its scope is unknown, so it is not established as a per-traveler or party total. This is a cash comparison point, not a complete award option.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Shared limits: all three award leads are for January 1 and report economy, but each has date-only scheduling and no leg-cabin details. The records report seat counts but no returned traveler counts, so verify award support for your requested one traveler rather than treating those counts as confirmation. The search results show no complete selectable award itinerary; search coverage was partial, so these leads do not establish that no other options exist. Confirm current availability and prices with the booking program before making plans.\"}]}"
